                                                               PROJECT TITLE: AI-Based Career Recommendation System

1. Project Overview

The AI-Based Career Recommendation System is a machine learning-based application that recommends suitable career paths to students based on their skills, interests, academic performance, technical knowledge, and career preferences.

The system analyzes the user's inputs and uses machine learning techniques to identify suitable career options.

 2. Input

The system will collect the following information from the user:

* Academic performance / CGPA
* Technical skills
* Programming languages known
* Domain interests
* Soft skills
* Aptitude level
* Communication skills
* Problem-solving ability
* Preferred work domain
* Career interests
* Certifications
* Projects / practical experience

 Example Input

* CGPA: 8.8
* Programming: Python, SQL
* Technical Skills: Machine Learning, Data Analysis
* Interest: Artificial Intelligence
* Communication: Good
* Problem Solving: Excellent
* Certifications: Machine Learning, Python

3. Dataset

A suitable Career Recommendation Dataset will be used for training and testing the machine learning model.

The dataset may contain features such as:

* Programming skills
* Database skills
* Machine Learning knowledge
* Data Analysis skills
* Communication skills
* Aptitude
* Problem-solving skills
* Interest areas
* Academic performance
* Career / Job Role

 Possible Career Classes

The model can recommend career roles such as:

* Data Analyst
* Data Scientist
* Machine Learning Engineer
* AI Engineer
* Python Developer
* Software Developer
* Web Developer
* Business Analyst
* Cloud Engineer
* Cybersecurity Analyst

The dataset will be cleaned, preprocessed, and converted into a suitable format before training the model.

 4. Technologies

 Programming Language

* Python

### Libraries

